{"id":"ceremonia","lemma":"ceremonia","pos":"noun","rank":1969,"glosses":["ceremony"],"ipa":"/θeɾeˈmonja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ceremonias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ceremonia.wav","examples":[{"text":"La ceremonia fue imponente.","en":"The ceremony was impressive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512885"},{"text":"Él asistió a muchas ceremonias.","en":"He attended many ceremonies."},{"text":"Filmaron toda la ceremonia.","en":"They filmed the entire ceremony.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684592"},{"text":"La ceremonia inaugural se realizó ayer.","en":"The opening ceremony took place yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733140"},{"text":"Tienes que ponerte una chaqueta de ceremonia.","en":"You need to wear a tuxedo.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296237"}]}